# Embedded Unity tests

The Unity suite in `test_inventatory_scan_core.cpp` is compiled into firmware
for the Scan R1 ESP32-S3. The hosted CI job builds this test image but does not
upload it or execute its assertions.

Compile the test image without uploading or running assertions:

```sh
pio test -e tenstar_esp32s3_zero_usb --without-uploading --without-testing
```

Run the assertions on an attached Scan R1 board (uploads the image first):

```sh
pio test -e tenstar_esp32s3_zero_usb
```

The hardware command requires an attached board and explicit authorization.
